### 1. Testar CPF com tamanho incorreto (Deve retornar erro 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/cliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Teste Tamanho CPF",
    "email": "erro@gmail.com",
    "senha": "123",
    "cpf": "12345",
    "telefone": "48900000000"
}

### 2. Cadastrar cliente 1 - Marcos (Público)
POST http://localhost:3000/cliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Marcos",
    "email": "marcos@gmail.com",
    "senha": "123",
    "cpf": "12345678912",
    "telefone": "48999998888"
}

### 3. Cadastrar cliente 2 - Ana (Público)
POST http://localhost:3000/cliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Ana",
    "email": "ana@gmail.com",
    "senha": "123",
    "cpf": "22233344455",
    "telefone": "48988887777"
